be]] [[old]] [[too]]. [[Every]] [[time]] Quang [[runs|run]] [[downstairs]], [[one]] [[stair]] [[says|say]], \`Creak!\` Uyen [[calls|call]] [[it]] \`[[the]] [[singing]] [[stair]].\` \`[[This]] [[house]] [[is|be]] [[too]] [[big]],\` [[says|say]] [[Mum]]. \`[[We]] [[need]] [[a]] [[lift]]!\` [[Dad]] [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[It]] [[has|have]] [[only]] [[two]] [[floors|floor]], Ly.\``,`vn`:`C\u1ea7u thang c\u0169ng \u0111\u00e3 c\u0169. M\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n Quang ch\u1ea1y xu\u1ed1ng t\u1ea7ng d\u01b0\u1edbi, c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t b\u1eadc l\u1ea1i k\u00eau \`C\u00f3t k\u00e9t!\`. Uy\u00ean g\u1ecdi n\u00f3 l\u00e0 \`b\u1eadc thang bi\u1ebft h\u00e1t\`. \`Nh\u00e0 n\u00e0y r\u1ed9ng qu\u00e1,\` m\u1eb9 n\u00f3i. \`Ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 thang m\u00e1y m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c!\` B\u1ed1 c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`Nh\u00e0 c\u00f3 hai t\u1ea7ng th\u00f4i m\u00e0, em.\``},{`en`:`[[Mum]] [[is|be]] [[cleaning]] [[all]] [[the]] [[time]]. [[She]] [[takes|take]] [[out]] [[bags|bag]] [[of]] [[rubbish]] [[and]] [[fills|fill]] [[three]] [[bins|bin]]. [[Under]] an [[old]] [[carpet]], [[she]] [[finds|find]] [[a]] [[box]] [[of]] [[photos|photo]]. [[In]] [[one]] [[photo]], an [[old]] [[woman]] [[is|be]] [[sitting|sit]] [[at]] [[a]] [[piano]] [[and]] [[smiling|smile]].`,`vn`:`L\u00fac n\u00e0o m\u1eb9 c\u0169ng d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p. M\u1eb9 mang ra m\u1ea5y t\u00fai r\u00e1c, \u0111\u1ea7y c\u1ea3 ba th\u00f9ng. D\u01b0\u1edbi m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m th\u1ea3m c\u0169, m\u1eb9 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t h\u1ed9p \u1ea3nh. Trong m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m \u1ea3nh, c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0 c\u1ee5 \u0111ang ng\u1ed3i b\u00ean c\u00e2y \u0111\u00e0n piano v\u00e0 m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi.`},{`en`:`[[Slowly]] [[the]] [[house]] [[becomes|become]] [[a]] [[home]]. [[Dad]] [[makes|make]] [[new]] [[furniture]]. [[There]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[long]] [[seat]] [[for]] [[the]] [[garden]] [[and]] [[a]] [[bed]] [[for]] Uyen. [[He]] [[also]] [[makes|make]] [[a]] [[lamp]] [[in]] [[the]] [[shape]] [[of]] [[a]] [[cat]]. [[Mum]] [[puts|put]] [[a]] [[big]] [[mirror]] [[in]] [[the]] [[hall]]. Uyen [[looks|look]] [[in]] [[the]] [[mirror]] [[with]] Miu. \`[[Two]] [[beautiful]] [[cats|cat]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]].`,`vn`:`D\u1ea7n d\u1ea7n, ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh t\u1ed5 \u1ea5m. B\u1ed1 \u0111\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ed3 \u0111\u1ea1c m\u1edbi. C\u00f3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc gh\u1ebf d\u00e0i cho khu v\u01b0\u1eddn v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc gi\u01b0\u1eddng cho Uy\u00ean. B\u1ed1 c\u00f2n l\u00e0m c\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111\u00e8n h\u00ecnh con m\u00e8o. M\u1eb9 treo m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc g\u01b0\u01a1ng l\u1edbn \u1edf h\u00e0nh lang. Uy\u00ean \u0111\u1ee9ng soi g\u01b0\u01a1ng c\u00f9ng Miu. \`Hai con m\u00e8o xinh \u0111\u1eb9p,\` b\u00e9 n\u00f3i.`},{`en`:`[[After]] [[all]] [[the]] [[cleaning]], [[the]] [[family]] [[is|be]] [[tired]] [[and]] [[happy]]. [[But]] [[that]] [[night]], Quang [[cannot]] [[sleep]]. [[He]] [[goes|go]] [[out]] [[and]] [[looks|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[little]] [[door]] [[next to]] [[his]] [[room]]. [[Under]] [[it]], [[there]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[thin]] [[line]] [[of]] [[light]].`,`vn`:`D\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p xong xu\u00f4i, c\u1ea3 nh\u00e0 m\u1ec7t nh\u01b0ng vui. Nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u00eam \u0111\u00f3, Quang kh\u00f4ng ng\u1ee7 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c. C\u1eadu ra ngo\u00e0i, nh\u00ecn c\u00e1nh c\u1eeda nh\u1ecf c\u1ea1nh ph\u00f2ng m\u00ecnh. B\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi khe c\u1eeda c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t v\u1ec7t s\u00e1ng m\u1ea3nh.`}],`tease`:`Ai b\u1eadt \u0111\u00e8n trong c\u0103n ph\u00f2ng kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a?`}]}